        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Rosenthal, Gary Nelson, Sean Penn\n- Works: Bad Boys, The Black Hole, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Smallville\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Roles: Film director, television director, film instructor\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Rosenthal was born on June 15, 1949, and he is an American film instructor and director.\n- Gary Nelson was born in January 1934, and he is an American television and film director.\n- The Black Hole is a 1979 American science fiction film directed by Gary Nelson and produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Rick Rosenthal is best known for directing Bad Boys, a 1983 drama film that helped launch Sean Penn's career.\n- Rick Rosenthal also directed episodes of television series including Buffy the Vampire Slayer and Smallville.",
